  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab><placeName ref="namedentities.xml#haymarket">Theatre-Royal, Hay-Market</placeName>.<lb/>
               This <hi rend="allcaps">Evening</hi>, <date when="1811-05-30">Thursday, May 30, 1811</date>,<lb/>
               Will be perform'd the Comick Opera of<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_inkle_and_yarico">Inkle and Yarico.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Inkle,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Cooper</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Sir Christopher Curry,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Barnes</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Medium,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Campley,</role> (with <hi rend="italic">"Let <hi rend="allcaps">Fame</hi> sound the <hi rend="allcaps">Trumpet</hi>"</hi>) <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Paine</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Mate,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Sailors,</role> Messers. <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_mi">Minton<hi rend="allcaps"></hi>,</actor> <actor><hi rend="allcaps">Hodson,</hi></actor> &amp;c.</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Planters,</role> Messrs. <actor>Lewes,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ge_sm">Smith,</actor> and <actor>Haughton.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Servant,</role> <actor>Mr. Widdicombe.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Waiter,</role> <actor>Mr. Linton.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Trudge,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mallinson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Yarico,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_gi">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Wowski,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#sa_li">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Liston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Patty,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Watson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Narcissa,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bellchambers</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               After which (Fifth Time) A Comick Piece in Two Acts, call'd The<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_trial_by_jury">Trial by Jury.</title></bibl><lb/>
               With <hi rend="allcaps">New Scenery, Dresses</hi>, &amp;c.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head>The Characters by</head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_wi_el">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Barnes</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">R. Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_li">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Liston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bellchambers</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem>And <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_gi">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               To which will be added, a Burlesque Tragick Opera in One Act, calld'd<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_bombastes_furioso">Bombastes Furioso.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Artaxominous, (King of Utopia)</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mallinson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Fusbos, (Minister of State)</role> (First Time) <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Paine</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>General Bombastes,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_li">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Liston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Courtiers,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Lewes</hi>.</actor> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Hodson</hi></actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Distaffina,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Watson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Boxes</hi> <measure type="currency">5s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">Pit</hi> <measure type="currency">3s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">First Gallery</hi> <measure type="currency">2s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">Second Gallery</hi> <measure type="currency">1s</measure>.<lb/>
               The Doors to be Opened at <time when="18:00:00">Six o'Clock</time>, and the Performance to begin at <time when="19:00:00">Seven</time>.<lb/>
               Places for the Boxes to be taken of <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mr_mas">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Massingham</hi></persName> at the Theatre.<lb/>
               The Publick is respectfully inform'd that The New Comick Piece of The <hi rend="allcaps">Trial</hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">By Jury</hi> continuing to be received with unbounded and reiterated applause, will be<lb/>
               repeated every evening, till further notice.</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
  </text>
